cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these datasets, please cite them as below."
title: "India Industrial Systems: Atlas Datasets"
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "Techadyant Labs"
    website: "https://labs.techadyant.com/"
identifiers:
  - type: url
    value: "https://labs.techadyant.com/research/"
    description: "The Atlas - live version of these datasets"
abstract: >-
  Three machine-readable CSV datasets backing The Atlas at Techadyant Labs:
  (1) India's 11 national industrial corridors and their anchor nodes, with stage,
  area, cost, investment potential, jobs, sectors, developer, EPC and anchor tenants;
  (2) import-dependency assessments scored 0-5 across six value-chain layers for
  seven-plus industrial corridors, each with a verification label, assessment date
  and written rationale; and (3) a directory of organisations tracked across India's
  strategic industrial ecosystem, classified by type, country, corridor tags and a
  sourced description.
keywords:
  - India
  - industrial corridors
  - semiconductors
  - critical minerals
  - AI infrastructure
  - defence
  - enterprise software
  - import dependency
  - supply chain
  - industrial policy
  - strategic autonomy
